,"target_id":"4cb8-a69d-5f83-40ac"},{"link_uuid":"1a9904d0-386c-47f8-8eb0-6cd4950a5bfb","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"f549-2366-4cd3-47a1"},{"link_uuid":"de8a4e73-068b-4c60-affc-d86a2f5c0eec","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"586b-f3c4-8b20-434e"}],"description":"## Context / Problem\nThe tests cohort contains audited comments or docstrings that obscure current behavior with repetition, obvious narration, duplicated explanation, or historical detail. The audit is pinned to `9e65567b79ffe872534c3c656ade7b34340d8192`.\n\n## Approach\nEdit explanatory text only in this directory/subsystem cohort. Condense it to current, non-obvious rationale and constraints; retain every file-specific preserve item and consumer contract below. Grouping adjacent files from one subsystem keeps the change reviewable in one session and permits one coherent verification pass without changing executable behavior.\n\n## Scope\n- `tests/e2e/js/browser_batch_library.mjs:1-11` — Preserve one-line purpose and invocation. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/e2e/js/browser_batch.mjs:1-11` — Preserve one-line purpose and invocation; inline sections already express the scenario. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/e2e/js/browser_structured.mjs:1-10` — Preserve purpose, invocation, round-trip, validation, and no-loss expectations. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/mocks/jira-cassette-loader.py:2-30` — Preserve cassette schema, request matching, and explicitly supported replay behavior. Consumer: none found.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Every listed location contains only current, non-obvious rationale or constraints after remediation; verified by reviewing the final diff against every Scope row.\n- [ ] Every preserve item and consumer contract in Scope remains explicit and accurate; verified by a row-by-row completion comment and the commands under Verification.\n- [ ] No executable behavior or test assertion changes; verified by the commands under Verification exiting 0.\n\n## Verification\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" make lint`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" .venv/bin/python scripts/check_comment_hygiene.py`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" pytest --collect-only tests/e2e/js/browser_batch_library.mjs tests/e2e/js/browser_batch.mjs tests/e2e/js/browser_structured.mjs tests/mocks/jira-cassette-loader.py`\n\nThe row-by-row diff review is authoritative for prose quality; the hygiene guard detects only its narrow deterministic history-token rule.","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[{"path":"tests/e2e/js/browser_batch_library.mjs","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"tests/e2e/js/browser_batch.mjs","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"tests/e2e/js/browser_structured.mjs","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"tests/mocks/jira-cassette-loader.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["parent","2d43-3c39-307e-4450"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"2d43-3c39-307e-4450","parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":3,"repos":["rebar"],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["comments","documentation","maintainability","grouped-remediation"],"ticket_id":"cede-1512-21b1-4f25","ticket_type":"task","title":"Condense comments in tests — cohort 02: browser_batch_library–jira-cassette-loader","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["2d530517-285c-46b1-a4f7-17f63ae88288","c7bdf5cd-3f56-465a-9dd9-72f734833f64","1dcbbc86-f43c-49b6-9a8e-7355d9362a83","ed6537ff-d5c2-4a56-9284-9af928468888","1a9904d0-386c-47f8-8eb0-6cd4950a5bfb","de8a4e73-068b-4c60-affc-d86a2f5c0eec"]},"env_id":"","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1788589182694191955,"uuid":"ee44ac8b-71ea-430e-bbe5-e4256450f804"}